@Bettina Kroll, I couldn't set up the Monday digest. My scheduler is blocked: the Gateway rejects my connection because it has no credentials configured, so I can't create or list recurring jobs. I haven't posted anything or set anything up, so nothing is scheduled yet.

Once scheduling works, the digest would post here at 08:00 America/Chicago every Monday, starting Monday 19 October. It would cover #coastal-team and #coastal-random, which have the same members (you, Kwame, Sofia and me), so nobody would see anything they can't already see. It would leave out money terms (rates, prices, discounts, contract values, invoice amounts, payment terms), since those can only go to Anselm, June and the account owner. Ops facts like seat counts, renewal dates and ticket numbers would stay in.

To get this running, someone with Gateway admin access needs to fix the scheduler's auth. Or I can post a manual digest from here until then. Tell me which you'd prefer.
